---
import { timeline } from '../data/timeline';
import { studio } from '../data/studio';
---

<article>
  <header class="shell plate">
    <div class="plate-head">
      <p class="label">History</p>
      <p class="label-cn">{timeline.length} 个阶段 · 自 {studio.foundedOn} 起</p>
    </div>

    <h1 class="display">我们的故事</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      方块纪元工作室成立于 {studio.foundedOnLabel}，是一家《我的世界》网易版工作室。
      这份沿革从成立那天记起，逐段标注作品投稿与上架的节点。
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- Figure 1 — the origin photograph, printed rather than blurred into wallpaper. -->
  <section class="shell block">
    <div class="tick-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <figure class="plate-figure">
      <img src="/imgs/cover-random-island.jpg" alt="《[方块纪元]随机空岛生存-周年庆》封面" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption>
        <span class="label">Fig. 01</span>
        <span class="figure-text">
          《[方块纪元]随机空岛生存-周年庆》封面。工作室成立后的第一个月，地图与皮肤两条线同时开工：
          {studio.foundedOnLabel} 成立，次日便投出第一款皮肤，一个月内 5 件组件全部通过审核上架。
        </span>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="shell block">
    <div class="tick-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="index-head"><p class="label">Chronology</p></div>

    <ol class="chrono">
      {timeline.map((event, index) => (
        <li class="chrono-item">
          <div class="chrono-spine">
            <span class="chrono-no">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
            <span class="chrono-year data">{event.year}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="chrono-body">
            <h2 class="chrono-title">{event.title}</h2>
            <p class="chrono-text">{event.description}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

</article>

<style>
  .plate-figure {
    margin: 16px 0 0;
  }

  .plate-figure img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .plate-figure figcaption {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .plate-figure figcaption {
      grid-template-columns: 62px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }

  .figure-text {
    max-width: 62ch;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--fg-2);
  }

  .chrono {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }

  .chrono-item {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-block: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }

  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .chrono-item {
      grid-template-columns: 150px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 48px;
    }
  }

  .chrono-spine {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 820px) {
    .chrono-spine {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
  }

  .chrono-no {
    font-family: var(--font-stamp);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .chrono-year {
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }

  .chrono-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .chrono-text {
    max-width: 62ch;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: var(--fg-2);
  }

  .appendix {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }

  .appendix:first-of-type {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }

  .appendix > summary {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4px;
    padding-block: 20px;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    opacity: 0.4;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .appendix > summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .appendix:hover > summary,
  .appendix[open] > summary {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .appendix.is-redacted > summary {
    opacity: 0.22;
  }

  .appendix-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .appendix-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }

  .ledger {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }

  .ledger li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 30px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
    padding-block: 10px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
  }

  .ledger-no {
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }

  .ledger-text {
    max-width: 68ch;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--fg-2);
  }

  .is-redacted .ledger-text {
    color: var(--fg-3);
  }
</style>
